      "t": "Unwilling to profit at the expense of impoverished colleagues, she firmly announces the immediate cancellation of her project. In response, the terrified dean makes a frantic confession about the violent blackmail he faces behind the scenes. Let's listen to their heated exchange in Russian first; don't worry about catching every word.",
